cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the accompanying paper."
title: "Conformal Cross-Modal Firewalls: Calibrated Pre-Model Defenses for Visual Prompt Injection"
abstract: >
  A pre-model defense for visual prompt injection that combines OCR span
  extraction, a two-component SigLIP-based risk score (instruction-match plus
  clipped image-text inconsistency, derived as a Neyman--Pearson log-likelihood
  ratio under a von Mises--Fisher embedding model), and inductive conformal
  calibration of the masking threshold. The conformal calibration provides a
  distribution-free finite-sample bound on the clean false positive rate.
authors:
